#: general.page.php:417
#: general.page.php:602
msgid ""
"Hostname or address for the STUN server used when determining the external "
"IP address and port an RTP session can be reached at. The port number is "
"optional. If omitted the default value of 3478 will be used. This option is "
"blank by default. (A list of STUN servers: https://sangomakb.atlassian.net/"
"wiki/spaces/PG/pages/25824149/PBX+GUI+-+STUN+Servers)"
msgstr ""
"用於判定外部 IP 地址與 RTP 連接埠位址的 STUN 伺服器主機名稱或地址。連接埠號為選用。若省略，將使用預設值 3478。此選項預設為空白。（STUN 伺服器清單：https://sangomakb.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/PG/pages/25824149/PBX+GUI+-+STUN+Servers）"

#: general.page.php:441
#: general.page.php:626
msgid ""
"Hostname or address for the TURN server to be used as a relay. The port "
